          .num_remark
            %h6#remark Remark
            %p
              So equivalently, one may say that a locally ∞-connected (∞,1)-topos
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
