              has a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/shape+of+an+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} shape
              which is
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable+functor"} representable
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fundamental+%E2%88%9E-groupoid"} fundamental ∞-groupoid
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi Π
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi H
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Pi(\mathbf{H})
              is the representing object.
